Invariant check failed
to_reference_type
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
N5008 [except.handle]: a `catch(T *)` handler must type-check.  Regression test
for the invariant violation in cpp_exception_list_rec, which used
to_reference_type (asserting ID_C_reference) on a genuine pointer handler type.
Surfaced in CBMC's own typecheck.cpp.
